### Description

Query the host topology tree of a specified business. Each node in the tree returns the number of hosts under that node (deduplicated across its child nodes).

This API only supports business (`biz`). If the resource scope type is business set (`biz_set`) or tenant set (`tenant_set`), a parameter error is returned. The returned topology tree is fully expanded by default and returns the complete hierarchy level by level through the `child` field, without pagination or lazy loading. The caller must have access permission on the target business.

### Request Parameters

#### Body Parameters

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| bk_scope_type | string | Yes | Resource scope type. This API only supports `biz` (business); passing `biz_set` (business set) or `tenant_set` (tenant set) returns a parameter error |
| bk_scope_id | string | Yes | Resource scope ID corresponding to `bk_scope_type`, representing a business ID |

### Request Example

- POST

```json
{
  "bk_scope_type": "biz",
  "bk_scope_id": "2"
}
```

