        "child": [
          {
            "object_id": "module",
            "object_name": "module",
            "instance_id": 100,
            "instance_name": "demo-module",
            "host_count": 3
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "job_request_id": "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
}
```

### Response Parameters

{% include '_generic_v4_response.md.j2' %}

#### data

| Field | Type | Always Present | Description |
|-------|------|----------------|-------------|
| object_id | string | Yes | Node type ID. Possible values: `biz` (business), `set` (set), `module` (module) |
| object_name | string | Yes | Node type name |
| instance_id | long | Yes | Node instance ID |
| instance_name | string | Yes | Node instance name |
| host_count | int | Yes | Number of hosts under this node (deduplicated across all child nodes) |
| child | array | No | Child node list with the same structure as this node; not returned for leaf nodes |

##### child[] item

| Field | Type | Always Present | Description |
|-------|------|----------------|-------------|
| object_id | string | Yes | Node type ID. Possible values: `biz` (business), `set` (set), `module` (module) |
| object_name | string | Yes | Node type name |
| instance_id | long | Yes | Node instance ID |
| instance_name | string | Yes | Node instance name |
| host_count | int | Yes | Number of hosts under this node (deduplicated across all child nodes) |
| child | array | No | Child node list with the same structure as the parent, recursing level by level down to leaf nodes; not returned for leaf nodes |
